// Chat → memory cases (assistant-memory plan Task 8), frozen before the prompt was tuned.
// msg: the user's message; prev: the user's own previous message; topics: active topics; rejected: [topic, text].
// expect.adds: each wanted write; file/person/topic alternatives with "|"; has: every group must be in the text
// (alternatives with "|"); not: none may be. An empty adds list means nothing is written. expect.forget: topics.
// Any write that matches nothing wanted is a wrong write.
